<title>USA: Fairfield Communities Q3 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Fairfield Communities Q3 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAIRFIELD COMMUNITIES INC</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 9/30	9 Mos ended 9/30</p>
<p>			     1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p>  Total Revenues     49,696    42,949    128,914   105,297</p>
<p>  Total Expenses     41,094    37,700    109,059    95,558</p>
<p>  Net earnings	  5,213     3,254     12,045     6,038</p>
<p>  Net EPS--Primary     0.46	0.29	 1.07	0.55</p>
<p>    Fully diluted	0.43	0.28	 1.01	0.51</p>
<p>Wgtd avg shrs</p>
<p>   Primary	 11,401,714 11,119,530 11,287,146 11,065,342</p>
<p>Fully diluted 11,999,075 11,768,264 11,967,241 11,768,264</p>
<p>	  (Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
